hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2882","Narrated to us 'Ali ibn Khashram, who said: Narrated to us 'Isa ibn Yunus, on the authority of 'Ubaydullah (who is Ibn Abi Ziyad), who said: Narrated to us al-Qasim, on the authority of 'Aishah (RA), who said:\nThe Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \The circumambulation of the House (Tawaf)"","" the walking between Safa and Marwah (Sa'i)"","" and the stoning of the Jamarat were only prescribed to establish the remembrance of Allah.\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
